    "parrafos": [
      "The 997.1 Carrera 4S uses the naturally aspirated, water-cooled <strong>3.8-litre</strong> flat-six, mounted behind the rear axle, with <strong>all-wheel drive</strong>. The Porsche vehicle data sheet records engine code <strong>9701</strong> and transmission code <strong>A9731</strong>.",
      "The <strong>Tiptronic</strong> transmission (code 249) can also be operated from the steering wheel (432). It is joined by <strong>PASM</strong> adaptive dampers (475), <strong>PSM</strong> stability control (476) and the <strong>Sport Chrono Plus</strong> package (640), with its stopwatch on the dashboard."
